        "original_id": "19b6c6a9-a577-5cab-91f8-984ae8b1e31f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sophia Petrillo, Bea Arthur, Estelle Getty, Sylvester Stallone\n- Roles: Dorothy Zbornak\n- TV Shows: The Golden Girls, The Golden Palace, Empty Nest\n- Films: Stop! Or My Mom Will Shoot\n- Awards: Emmy, Golden Globe\n\nFacts:\n- Beatrice \"Bea\" Arthur, born Bernice Frankel, was an American actress, comedian, singer, and animal rights activist who lived from May 13, 1922 to April 25, 2009.\n- On The Golden Girls, Bea Arthur played Dorothy Zbornak, the daughter of Sophia Petrillo.\n- In real life, Bea Arthur was one year older than Estelle Getty.\n- Estelle Getty was best known for playing Sophia Petrillo on The Golden Girls from 1985 to 1992, and that role won her an Emmy and a Golden Globe.\n- Estelle Getty played Sophia Petrillo on The Golden Palace from 1992 to 1993.\n- Estelle Getty played Sophia Petrillo on Empty Nest from 1993 to 1995.\n- The film Stop! Or My Mom Will Shoot starred Sylvester Stallone and Estelle Getty.",
